# Cached third-party pages and data extracted from them.
# Artemis.bm forbids reproduction/publication without a licence and this repo
# is PUBLIC, so the scrape and its derived tables stay local. The code that
# produces them is tracked; the content is not. Re-fetch with src/fetch.py.
raw/
data/raw/
data/*.csv

# Worktrees share the cache and venv by symlink; "raw/" and ".venv/" with a
# trailing slash match directories only, so the symlink forms were tracked.
/raw
/.venv
/data/raw
plots/*.png
plots/*.svg

# Adversarial review reports and prompts: working notes, not deliverables.
REVIEW_ROUND*.md
REVIEW_PROMPT.md
